---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';import Timeline from '../components/Timeline';import {articles} from '../lib/data';
---
<Base title="Coverage timeline"><div class="page-heading"><span class="kicker">CHRONOLOGY / 01 OCT — 21 NOV 2026</span><h1>Coverage timeline</h1><p>A daily view of the currently verified file. Dates with no bars mean there are no verified records in this dataset, not that no coverage occurred.</p></div><Timeline articles={articles} client:only="react" /><div class="event-note panel"><span class="kicker">DOCUMENTED EVENT</span><h2>12 November 2026 · NVIDIA announces CEO transition</h2><p>NVIDIA’s <a href="https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/news/nvidia-announces-ceo-transition/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">company announcement</a> records Huang’s resignation. The timeline uses this as an event marker; it does not infer why later stories appeared.</p></div></Base>
<style>.event-note{padding:26px;margin-top:30px;border-left:2px solid #df6961}.event-note h2{font:600 22px 'Playfair Display',serif;margin:12px 0}.event-note p{color:#aab9c6;line-height:1.6;margin:0}.event-note a{color:#f18a83;text-decoration:underline}</style>
